WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you for taking time
out of this busy week.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.036 size:75% position:38%
-Man, yes of course.
I wanted to see you.

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:03.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wanted to see you...
-Yeah.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.472
-...ever since you said some
nice stuff about my special.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your special -- and I want to
talk about your special --

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
is "100% fresh."
-Yes, yes.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is as good a comedy special
as I've seen in years.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:14.414 size:75% position:38%
It made me so happy.
-Thank you so much.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
And thanks for saying
the nice stuff.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
All my friends
sent me your tweet

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.953
and all the nice stuff you said,
so thank you.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that's good.
I mean, I gotta be honest,

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think a tweet from me
is gonna be real good for you.

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:24.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think it's healthy.
It's healthy.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:25.291 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:26.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it's gonna be really...
[ Laughs ]

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.128 line:92%
-Why -- It's been 20-plus years,

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:30.764 size:81% position:41%
maybe almost 25 years,
since you left "SNL."

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-I mean, I have to imagine

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
you've been asked to host
over the years.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.768 line:92%
What made now the right time?

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a mistake.
-Yeah.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:37.871 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They caught me
in a weak moment.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:43.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, those guys are great.
I... [ Stammers ]

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.544 size:78% position:39% line:92%
The special came out,

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.547
and then some guys from
"Saturday Night Live" called me

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said, "Come on, come host"
and blah blah blah.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they were talking about,
you know,

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.520 line:92%
watching the special together.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Yeah, yeah, yeah.
You're right, man.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me come do it."
And I love Lorne

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I wanted to see Lorne
and do it with him

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:03.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
and be on the show
and bring back some nice --

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I've gotta tell you,
it's knocked me out.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:06.566 line:92%
I'm so knocked out right now.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.201
-Yeah.
Also, I think the difference --

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:10.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause, you know, I went back
this year as well.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.639 size:75% position:38%
They asked me, like,
a week beforehand.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:13.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh yeah?
-So I didn't have --

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause you've had some time
to think about it.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.811
-Yes, yes, yes.
-Have you had stress coming in?

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:19.345
'Cause it's been, like,
months that you've known.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:22.782
-Yes. Yes. I've been very --
I've been watching the show

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.516 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and I've been laughing.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was, "Oh, man, that guy
is good" or "She's good."

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm nervous about me.
And now...

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:28.655 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I just --
it's really been, like --

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
This week...
-It's so hard.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It really is a knockout.
I should have --

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all, I should have
come back to the show

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.265 size:75% position:38% line:92%
before there was HD.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Because now I'm like,

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.169 size:75% position:38%
"Good Lord, I waited
a long, long time.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't really look
like Adam Sandler anymore,

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:46.840 size:81% position:41% line:92%
but that's all right."

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:49.175
But -- but I'm just -- yeah, no.
I am -- I'm gonna --

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Have you -- I know backstage,
I saw some of the guys

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
you used to write with --
-Yeah.

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...back in the day.
You came back.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:55.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Has that been nice

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
having them around?
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:57.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
Herlihy and Smigel
and Steve Koren

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:01.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all my guys that were
on the show with me back then

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.123 line:92%
and wrote a lot of stuff I did.

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:05.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
The writing staff was
very nice to 'em.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.160 line:92%
It was good. They feel like me.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I went there, and they're
so good and so young.

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so you do go, "Oh, my God.
I don't belong here."

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I would assume, like me,

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.606
you would stay very late
on Tuesday nights, writing.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:20.240 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you try that at all
this time?

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:22.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or were out of there pretty --
-I did.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, you did?
-I did one night.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Tuesday night one.
-Yeah.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When you do
"Saturday Night Live,"

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
you write the skits, like,
Monday, Tuesday kind of thing.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:30.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
And a lot of guys stay late
Tuesday, or the women.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.586 line:92%
And I stayed till, like, 4:00.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.854 line:92%
-Oh, that's pretty impressive.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It wasn't bad.
-Yeah.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I came back. I was delirious.
I was nasty.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:38.625 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.994
Nasty to the hotel guy
when my key wasn't ready.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:42.395 line:92%
I was like, "Come on, man!"

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was a little psychotic
but I-I'm good.

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have not bounced back
from that yet.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.902
Tonight, I gotta sleep, though.
-That's good.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I would imagine
that you're --

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like everybody at
this point has, like,

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
a very bad
Adam Sandler impression.

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:57.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yes.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.180
-And I always found that was
a fun week to write on the show.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
Christopher Walken,
everybody has a bad one.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:03.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right, right.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:04.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I remember
when he would host,

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.352
if you would walk down the hall,
you'd hear every writer, like,

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
typing and doing it in
Walken's voice.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.088 line:92%
You'd be like, "Oh, my God.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everybody is talking like
Christopher Walken this week."

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:13.059
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Yes, that happened at the show.

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:16.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did hear through the door
on occasion...

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:20.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, ya wa ya, boy."
I was like, "Oh, come on."

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:22.268 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:24.571
-"You know, switch it up.
We gotta show my range."

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:27.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I do other stuff.
No, I actually don't.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Did you go...

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:33.413 size:88% position:44%
Your office, I know this
from legend, is really

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:36.849
a Murderer's Row sort of
Mount Rushmore of that era.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:37.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You, Farley, Spade, and Rock
all shared an office.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right, yes.
We were in the back.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:43.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went and visited --
it's not --

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:43.756 size:88% position:44% line:92%
We're not there anymore.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:46.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's -- "Weekend Update" is
in our office.

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:46.793 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:48.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So yeah, I was really --
it was nice to see.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I did look
at Farley's old desk

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I thought of the crazy...
[ Laughs ]

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:55.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just him being funny there
and just the fun times we had.

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:57.704
And I know the "Weekend Update"
guys who were sitting

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:00.907
are a lot smarter than we are...
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.642
...and a lot of different
conversations going on.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:06.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Was it --
I mean, the level of filth

00:04:06.012 --> 00:04:07.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
in some of the offices
is stunning.

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Certainly in my era, too.

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:10.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Was yours --

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:13.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
And by "filth," I mean a lack
of cleanliness.

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.087 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, yes, yes.

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:17.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were you guys an uncleanly --
-Nobody picked up much.

00:04:17.624 --> 00:04:20.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
Farley, you know,
he didn't pick up much.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:25.665
-And Spade, you know, he wasn't
as filthy as Farley or me.

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:27.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
Rock kind of
took care of himself

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.201 line:92%
a little bit better than us.

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:31.337
But we did hit McDonald's a lot.
Did you guys used to do that?

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You'd walked out --

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you go out on your own?
'Cause I do feel bad

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:35.074 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
'cause my memory is

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:37.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
we would maybe send interns
out to McDonald's.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did?
-Yeah.

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:39.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, we went there.
We got excited to be in Mc--

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:42.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we were excited
to get recognized back then.

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:43.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-It was like, "Oh, man,

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:46.586
I think the lady gave me
extra cheese or something."

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:49.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I don't know.

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:50.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you would go out
fishing for --

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
you were, like,
one of those people

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.593 size:78% position:39%
who put your hood up
and sunglasses. Yeah.

00:04:53.593 --> 00:04:55.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, that just happened
this year.

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:56.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, I mean...
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:58.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
...I was definitely
walking down the street,

00:04:58.431 --> 00:04:59.632 line:92%
like, after a Saturday show.

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:01.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I did well on the show
and I was, you know,

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:04.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
23 years old, my God,
I was walking down the street

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:06.039 line:92%
and staring people in the eye.

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:08.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "That's right.
It's me, man."

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:12.412
-I remember every now and then,
they would give you, like --

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:13.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Christmas gift
would be, like,

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
a duffel bag that they'd give
to the cast.

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:17.050 size:88% position:44%
It would be a duffel bag
with "SNL" on the side.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.419
And you'd have to say,
"Well, I can't use this."

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:20.386 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Right, right, right.

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:21.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause I feel like
if I wear it,

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.523
it's like me desperately trying
to get people to, like,

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:25.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Huh? Huh?"
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:27.727
Seemed like you would have
jumped at that duffel bag.

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:32.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'd be all over
the bag back then.

